    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>Your heel finds a root as the impact lands. The branch in your hand bends, but you hold your ground.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Reaction</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self, before forced movement while you can grasp rooted vegetation.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Defense</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Gain Stability 3 against the triggering forced movement. If that movement would apply Prone, you remain standing.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30/design/cards/catch-the-root.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/catch-the-root.md</a> at <code>25b80c9fe77d7baaec3f3a8a548c9663d0f39a30</code>.</p></section>",
